{"seq":1,"slug":"alert-case-workflow","title":"警报分派与调查案件流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/aml-transaction-monitoring/alert-investigation-report/alert-case-workflow","wordCount":2367,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"警报分派与调查案件流\">警报分派与调查案件流</h1><p>引擎产出的&quot;命中&quot;只是一条原始信号。把它变成一份能报送监管的案件，中间要经过分派、调查、决策、复核、归档五个状态。这条流程的工程性质介于工单系统和法律程序之间：它像工单系统一样需要队列、分配、SLA；又像法律程序一样要求每一步都有责任人、有依据、有不可篡改的时间戳。</p>\n<p>设计案件流时最容易被低估的一点是：<strong>时间是法定的</strong>。可疑交易报告的报送时限通常从&quot;机构应当知道该交易可疑&quot;起算，而不是从&quot;调查完成&quot;起算。这意味着流程中每一个排队环节都在消耗合规时间，队列积压不只是运营问题，而是直接的合规违规。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一条警报的生命周期可以抽象为状态机。状态迁移的触发条件、执行者与时限是设计的三个核心要素。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; Generated: 规则命中&#10;  Generated --&gt; Deduped: 归并检查&#10;  Deduped --&gt; Assigned: 分派&#10;  Assigned --&gt; Investigating: 分析员接单&#10;  Investigating --&gt; Escalated: 需升级&#10;  Investigating --&gt; ClosedNoAction: 判定非可疑&#10;  Investigating --&gt; Reportable: 判定可疑&#10;  Escalated --&gt; Reportable: 确认可疑&#10;  Escalated --&gt; ClosedNoAction: 排除&#10;  Reportable --&gt; Reported: 报送完成&#10;  Reported --&gt; Archived: 归档&#10;  ClosedNoAction --&gt; Archived: 归档(需复核)&#10;  Archived --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; Generated: 规则命中\n  Generated --&gt; Deduped: 归并检查\n  Deduped --&gt; Assigned: 分派\n  Assigned --&gt; Investigating: 分析员接单\n  Investigating --&gt; Escalated: 需升级\n  Investigating --&gt; ClosedNoAction: 判定非可疑\n  Investigating --&gt; Reportable: 判定可疑\n  Escalated --&gt; Reportable: 确认可疑\n  Escalated --&gt; ClosedNoAction: 排除\n  Reportable --&gt; Reported: 报送完成\n  Reported --&gt; Archived: 归档\n  ClosedNoAction --&gt; Archived: 归档(需复核)\n  Archived --&gt; [*]</pre><p>状态机里有三个必须显式建模的机制：<code>Deduped</code> 的归并规则、<code>Escalated</code> 的升级条件、以及 <code>ClosedNoAction</code> 的复核要求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"警报归并与噪声控制\">警报归并与噪声控制</h2><h3 id=\"为什么需要归并\">为什么需要归并</h3><p>同一次可疑行为常常触发多条规则：一笔拆分交易同时命中&quot;落带计数&quot;&quot;渠道分散&quot;&quot;新账户&quot;三条规则，产生三个警报。如果不去重，调查员会看到三倍工作量，且无法形成对一次行为的完整认识。</p>\n<p>归并有三个层次：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>归并键</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>交易级</td>\n<td>同一 txn_id</td>\n<td>合并同一交易的多规则命中为一条警报，规则列表作为证据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主体级</td>\n<td>同一 entity_id + 时间窗</td>\n<td>合并短时间内的相关警报为一个案件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>案件级</td>\n<td>关联主体集合</td>\n<td>把对手方网络中的相关主体合并为一个案件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>交易级归并是无损的，应当始终执行。主体级归并需要在&quot;减少工作量&quot;与&quot;保留独立视角&quot;之间取舍——把 30 天内的所有警报合成一个案件可能导致案件过大而难以调查，因此通常限制归并窗口（例如 72 小时）并设置案件内警报数上限，超过上限时拆分为关联案件。</p>\n<h3 id=\"归并的留痕\">归并的留痕</h3><p>归并不能丢弃任何原始警报，只能建立<strong>父子关系</strong>。监管检查可能要求追溯某条规则在某个时期的全部命中，如果归并时删除了子记录，这个能力就失去了。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE aml_alert (&#10;  alert_id      BIGSERIAL   PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  entity_id     BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  rule_id       TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  rule_version  INT         NOT NULL,&#10;  txn_id        BIGINT,&#10;  severity      TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  score         NUMERIC(5,4),&#10;  created_at    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  parent_alert_id BIGINT REFERENCES aml_alert(alert_id),  -- 归并父子关系&#10;  dedup_key     TEXT,                                     -- 归并键，为空表示未被归并&#10;  state         TEXT        NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;generated&#39;&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 归并查询：找出窗口内同一主体可合并的未处置警报&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_aml_alert_dedup&#10;  ON aml_alert (entity_id, created_at DESC)&#10;  WHERE state IN (&#39;generated&#39;, &#39;assigned&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aml_alert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  alert_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entity_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rule_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rule_version  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  txn_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  severity      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  score         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  parent_alert_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> aml_alert(alert_id),  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 归并父子关系</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dedup_key     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                                     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 归并键，为空表示未被归并</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'generated'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 归并查询：找出窗口内同一主体可合并的未处置警报</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_aml_alert_dedup</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> aml_alert (entity_id, created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'generated'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'assigned'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>parent_alert_id</code> 自引用是最简单的归并表达。它保留了完整的原始记录，同时让查询可以按根警报聚合展示。</p>\n<h2 id=\"案件结构与分派\">案件结构与分派</h2><h3 id=\"案件是警报的容器\">案件是警报的容器</h3><p>案件（case）持有调查所需的全部上下文，并在其生命周期内持续累积证据。它的结构决定了调查员能否在单一界面上完成工作。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;case_id&quot;: &quot;CASE-2026-118842&quot;,&#10;  &quot;created_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-27T10:20:03Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;trigger&quot;: { &quot;alert_ids&quot;: [991204, 991205], &quot;root_rule&quot;: &quot;AML-STRUCT-002&quot; },&#10;  &quot;subject&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;entity_id&quot;: 55201,&#10;    &quot;risk_tier_at_open&quot;: &quot;high&quot;,&#10;    &quot;customer_since&quot;: &quot;2025-02-14&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;severity&quot;: &quot;high&quot;,&#10;  &quot;sla&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;investigate_by&quot;: &quot;2026-09-28T10:20:03Z&quot;,&#10;    &quot;report_by&quot;: &quot;2026-10-04T23:59:59Z&quot;,&#10;    &quot;legal_basis&quot;: &quot;suspicious_transaction_report_deadline&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;state&quot;: &quot;assigned&quot;,&#10;  &quot;assignee&quot;: null,&#10;  &quot;evidence_refs&quot;: [],&#10;  &quot;decisions&quot;: []&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"case_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CASE-2026-118842\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"created_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-27T10:20:03Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"trigger\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"alert_ids\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">991204</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">991205</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"root_rule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"AML-STRUCT-002\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"subject\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"entity_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">55201</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"risk_tier_at_open\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"high\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"customer_since\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2025-02-14\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"severity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"high\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"sla\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"investigate_by\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-28T10:20:03Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"report_by\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-10-04T23:59:59Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"legal_basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"suspicious_transaction_report_deadline\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"state\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"assigned\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"assignee\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"evidence_refs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"decisions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>subject.risk_tier_at_open</code> 记录的是<strong>开案时刻</strong>的风险档，而不是当前值。这个快照很重要：风险档在调查过程中可能因为其他原因变化，而判定应当基于开案时系统所掌握的信息。这与 <a href=\"../customer-risk-tuning/customer-risk-rating-cdd-edd\">客户风险分级与 CDD/EDD</a> 中的时点快照要求一致。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分派策略\">分派策略</h3><p>分派决定谁来处理，需要考虑三个约束：<strong>技能匹配</strong>（跨境案件需要熟悉对应辖区的分析员）、<strong>负载均衡</strong>（避免某些人队列过长）、<strong>利益冲突</strong>（处理案件的不得是该客户的客户经理）。</p>\n<p>分派算法通常是规则驱动的兜底加人工干预：先按技能标签筛选候选池，再按当前未结案件数升序取最小，同时排除与主体存在关联的人员。全自动分派在低风险案件上有效，高风险案件通常需要主管手动分派，因为它可能涉及跨部门协调。</p>\n<h3 id=\"优先级排序\">优先级排序</h3><p>队列排序不能只按严重度，因为高严重度案件可能很少而低严重度案件积压严重。实用的排序函数综合三个因子：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>ϵ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P = w_s \\cdot S + w_t \\cdot \\frac{1}{\\max(t_{deadline} - t_{now},\\, \\epsilon)} + w_a \\cdot A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2574em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 是严重度，第二项是时限紧迫度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 是主体风险档。时限项的分母在接近截止时迅速增大，保证临期案件自动上浮——这是防止时限违规的主要机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"调查与决策\">调查与决策</h2><h3 id=\"调查的标准动作\">调查的标准动作</h3><p>调查员的动作应当被结构化为可复现的步骤，而不是自由发挥。标准动作清单包括：核对主体身份与受益所有人、拉取窗口内完整交易流水、检查对手方是否在同一网络中出现过、比对名单、查阅历史案件与既往处置、必要时向业务线或客户索取说明（RFI）。</p>\n<p>把动作清单做成<strong>结构化任务</strong>而非自由文本备注，好处是可以度量完成度、可以在复核时逐项检查、可以在监管检查时证明流程的完备性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"决策的三种输出\">决策的三种输出</h3><p>调查结论只能有三种，且每一种都必须有理由：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>报送</strong>：存在合理怀疑，需提交可疑交易报告。理由必须包含具体事实而非规则编号。</li>\n<li><strong>不报送但留档</strong>：经过检查认为不可疑，但该判断本身需要留档，因为&quot;为什么判定不可疑&quot;与&quot;为什么判定可疑&quot;同等重要——检查员会质疑那些被快速关闭的案件。</li>\n<li><strong>升级</strong>：超出分析员职权或需要跨部门资源，升级到主管或专门小组。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>需要特别说明的是&quot;不报送但留档&quot;这一类的价值。一个健康的系统会在案件关闭时要求填写<strong>排除理由码</strong>，这些码事后被聚合分析，用于规则调优——某条规则的排除理由高度集中在&quot;客户为注册慈善机构&quot;上，说明该规则缺少对慈善机构的白名单处理。这个反馈闭环是第 4 章调优的数据来源。</p>\n<h3 id=\"复核与四眼原则\">复核与四眼原则</h3><p>高风险案件的报送决策必须经过复核。复核者的独立性要求与分析员不相同，且复核必须留下独立的时间戳与结论。常见的工程缺陷是把复核做成&quot;同一个人换个界面点确认&quot;，这既无实质价值又制造了虚假记录，在检查中反而成为负面证据。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE aml_case_decision (&#10;  decision_id   BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  case_id       TEXT      NOT NULL REFERENCES aml_case(case_id),&#10;  actor_id      TEXT      NOT NULL,&#10;  actor_role    TEXT      NOT NULL,       -- analyst | reviewer | approver&#10;  decision      TEXT      NOT NULL,       -- report | close | escalate&#10;  reason_code   TEXT,                     -- 关闭时的排除理由码&#10;  narrative     TEXT,&#10;  decided_at    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  CONSTRAINT chk_actor_distinct CHECK (true)  -- 独立性由应用层与唯一索引共同保证&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE UNIQUE INDEX uq_case_reviewer_distinct&#10;  ON aml_case_decision (case_id, actor_role)&#10;  WHERE actor_role = &#39;reviewer&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aml_case_decision</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decision_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  case_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> aml_case(case_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  actor_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  actor_role    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- analyst | reviewer | approver</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decision      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- report | close | escalate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reason_code   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 关闭时的排除理由码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  narrative     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decided_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chk_actor_distinct </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (true)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 独立性由应用层与唯一索引共同保证</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNIQUE INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> uq_case_reviewer_distinct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> aml_case_decision (case_id, actor_role)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> actor_role </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'reviewer'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>uq_case_reviewer_distinct</code> 只保证同一案件只有一个复核者，不保证复核者与分析员不同人——后者需要应用层校验，因为约束涉及跨行比较。这类&quot;约束跨行&quot;的规则在数据库层表达力有限，必须在服务层显式实现并测试，不能依赖数据库兜底。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时限管理与积压治理\">时限管理与积压治理</h2><h3 id=\"时限字段是一等公民\">时限字段是一等公民</h3><p>案件的每一个关键状态都必须伴随一个期限字段，且这些字段从<strong>事件发生时间</strong>起算而非录入时间。典型字段：调查完成期限、报送决策期限、报送提交期限。系统必须在临近期限时产生提醒，并在超期时产生升级事件而非静默过期。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>期限类型</th>\n<th>起算点</th>\n<th>典型长度</th>\n<th>超期后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>调查完成</td>\n<td>警报生成</td>\n<td>数个工作日</td>\n<td>内部升级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>报送决策</td>\n<td>警报生成</td>\n<td>法定时限的一部分</td>\n<td>合规违规</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>报送提交</td>\n<td>决策作出</td>\n<td>法定时限</td>\n<td>合规违规</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>归档</td>\n<td>报送完成</td>\n<td>内部规定</td>\n<td>内部提醒</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"积压的可观测性\">积压的可观测性</h3><p>积压不能只看总量，要看<strong>年龄分布</strong>。同样 500 条待处理，全部在 1 天内是所有健康状态；若其中 50 条已超过 20 天，则存在时限风险。因此监控面板必须展示按年龄分桶的积压，并按最紧迫的那一桶驱动人员调配。</p>\n<p>另一个容易被忽略的指标是<strong>重新分配次数</strong>。一条警报被反复转手说明它难以归类或分派策略有问题，这类警报往往在流程里停留最久。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>警报生命周期是状态机，归并、升级、关闭复核三个机制必须显式建模。</li>\n<li>归并只能建立父子关系，不能删除原始警报；交易级归并无损且应始终执行，主体级归并需限制窗口与规模。</li>\n<li>案件持有时点快照（开案时的风险档），保证判定基于当时掌握的信息。</li>\n<li>优先级排序必须包含时限紧迫度项，其分母在临期时迅速增大，这是防止超期的主要机制。</li>\n<li>调查动作应结构化为任务清单，关闭案件必须填写排除理由码，这些码是规则调优的输入。</li>\n<li>时限字段是一等公民且从事件时间起算；积压监控要看年龄分布而非总量。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>相关：规则命中如何变成警报见 <a href=\"../aml-scenario-rule/aml-rule-library\">监控规则库与阈值配置</a>；案件结论如何形成报送文件见 <a href=\"../alert-investigation-report/suspicious-ctr-str-report\">大额/可疑交易报告（CTR/STR）</a>；排除理由码如何驱动调优见 <a href=\"../customer-risk-tuning/alert-tuning-false-positive\">规则调优与误报治理</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"警报分派与调查案件流","id":"警报分派与调查案件流"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"警报归并与噪声控制","id":"警报归并与噪声控制"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么需要归并","id":"为什么需要归并"},{"level":3,"text":"归并的留痕","id":"归并的留痕"},{"level":2,"text":"案件结构与分派","id":"案件结构与分派"},{"level":3,"text":"案件是警报的容器","id":"案件是警报的容器"},{"level":3,"text":"分派策略","id":"分派策略"},{"level":3,"text":"优先级排序","id":"优先级排序"},{"level":2,"text":"调查与决策","id":"调查与决策"},{"level":3,"text":"调查的标准动作","id":"调查的标准动作"},{"level":3,"text":"决策的三种输出","id":"决策的三种输出"},{"level":3,"text":"复核与四眼原则","id":"复核与四眼原则"},{"level":2,"text":"时限管理与积压治理","id":"时限管理与积压治理"},{"level":3,"text":"时限字段是一等公民","id":"时限字段是一等公民"},{"level":3,"text":"积压的可观测性","id":"积压的可观测性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"名单命中关联联动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/aml-transaction-monitoring/realtime-screening-engine/watchlist-hit-correlation"},"next":{"title":"大额/可疑交易报告（CTR/STR）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/aml-transaction-monitoring/alert-investigation-report/suspicious-ctr-str-report"}}